{"id":122079988266644,"name":"Idle Potato Game","desc":"A 2D incremental idle/clicker game about potato farming. Start with nothing but a single potato plant and grow your tiny potato farm into an automated potato empire. It starts off simple but you unlock more layers and mechanics as you progress. Climb the leaderboards through strategic upgrades, automated generators, and our unique rebirth system.\n\nFeatures:\nAuto-clicker is free for everyone\nGlobal and Server-wide leaderboards to compare your stats\nEndless content and constant content updates\n200+ upgrades and perks to purchase\nPrestige/Rebirth system to get permanent multipliers - Multi-layered!\n300+ achievements to unlock\nTons of collectable potatoes that give stacking buffs and have unique animations. The more you collect, the more buffs you get!\nFind ultra rare potatoes just from playing!\nTrading system - Almost everything is tradable! Trade rare, epic, legendary, and mythic potatoes with other players!\nRotating global shop system\nOffline progress, your generators never sleep!","path":"/game/122079988266644-idle-potato-game","slug":"122079988266644-idle-potato-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0b16e11a7708b348b5d22df7a3b2adcfa2f3832fdb17d3d509623a80cd5bef63.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ab36fc93b62327190801fe38ad43e15/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":81,"visitor":10378321,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-18T12:27:14.631Z","creator":{"name":"Smooth Brain Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Idle-Potato-Game-EzScript-Update-135914","_id":"69ba9a221a7ab4067d3156fc","title":"EzScript Update","game":{"_id":"69995dd29a90b0011a7ef8b9","gameId":122079988266644,"name":"Idle Potato Game","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":1